    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Schedule\"\ntbl-colwidths: [10,10,20,5,5,5,5,5,5,5]\neditor_options: \n  chunk_output_type: console\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\nThis page contains an outline of the topics, content, and assignments for the semester.\nNote that this schedule will be updated as the semester progresses.\n\n**We will have meetups on Monday evenings at 7:00pm.** [Click here to join the meetup](https://us02web.zoom.us/j/84988569164?pwd=FWEeLQ4WRFU3uyJ6pNNh7dCyrlTFsZ.1).\n\nMeetups will be recorded and made available the next day on the course website. Although attending live is not strictly required, **I expect everyone to watch the lectures during the week**. I use the class meetups to convey important information and announcements. Very often I will cover some topics not in the textbook. Students who attend the meetups tend to do well on the assignments.\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n`````{=html}\n<table>\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Week </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\"> Start </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\"> End </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\"> Meetup </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\"> Topic </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Prepare </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Lab </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Slides </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Video </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Resources </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;\"> 2026-08-31 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;\"> 2026-09-06 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;\"> 2026-08-31 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;min-width: 300px; \"> Introduction to Predictive Modeling </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;max-width: 50px; \"> <a href=\"/modules/01-Intro_to_Modeling.html\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 576 512\" style=\"height:1em;position:relative;display:inline-block;top:.1em;\" x